{"version":1,"content":"<p>據周一提交的監管文件顯示，億萬富豪傑夫·貝索斯上周向多家非營利機構捐贈了價值約1.989億美元的亞馬遜股票，這是這位全球第二富豪一系列股票慈善捐贈中的最新一筆。文件顯示，貝索斯上周一共送出771492股亞馬遜股票：周四捐贈674088股，周五捐贈97404股。以亞馬遜周一收盤價257.75美元計算，這批捐贈股票總價值約1.989億美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586796.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:33:58.270340+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T12:17:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:27:13.176094+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T12:27:13.176094+00:00","content_hash":"540f9bc426291f808ab611cf1c1235ddac4dc38d689995c9efbaaa55a7044b08","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}